  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Leveraging Educators Against Radical Narratives (LEARN) (Memperkasa Pendidik Mencegah Fahaman Radikalisme) project seeks to carve out an early intervention, government-led strategy to address issues of and/or relating to violent extremism (VE) amongst youth, particularly in secondary schools.Recognising the important role of educators as gatekeepers , this project will seek to proactively address VE by equipping counselling teachers with up-to-date knowledge and best practices on identifying</narrative>
  </description>
